          </div>
          <ul class="list">
            <li>Assessment interventions aim to strengthen government institutions by promoting a 21st Century Competency (21st CC) assessment narrative through policy-level reforms.</li>
            <li>Focus on designing and implementing 21st CC assessment initiatives via continuous professional development.</li>
            <li>Assessment curriculum is integrated into the institution's academic calendar to ensure alignment with learning goals.</li>
            <li>Emphasis on developing and integrating tech solutions to enhance governance and M&amp;E systems.</li>
            <li>Tech-enabled systems ensure data-based continuous feedback and real-time inputs.</li>
            <li>The ultimate goal is to enable large-scale, sustainable impact through effective, competency-based assessment practices.</li>
